desc(
	mode: "struct"
	language: "python"
	title: "结构匹配：Python XSS: f-string HTML without escaping"
	title_zh: "结构匹配：Python XSS：f-string 拼 HTML 未转义"
	type: vuln
	level: "middle"
	risk: "xss"
	cwe: "CWE-79"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
f-string 把请求参数拼进 HTML 标签后直接返回。参数里如果带 `<script>`，浏览器会执行。

### 检测方式
匹配同时包含 HTML 标签和 `{...}` 占位符的字符串常量，并要求它被 `return` 使用。占位符里出现 `escape(` 视为已转义。

### 参考
- [CWE-79](https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/79.html)
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
- 用 `html.escape` 或模板引擎自动转义。
- 不要拼接原始请求参数。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	rule_id: "af8f2ca0-0cf3-418c-8bf6-d59a1c80e767"
)
*?{opcode: const}?{have: /<[a-zA-Z][^>]*>.*\{[A-Za-z_]/}?{!have: /\{[^}]*escape\(/} as $tpl
$tpl?{<getUsers()>?{opcode: return}} as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Python XSS: f-string HTML without escaping",
	title_zh: "Python XSS：f-string 拼 HTML 未转义",
	risk: "xss",
}

desc(
	lang: python
	alert_min: 1
	'file://app.py': <<<POS
# HTTP service wb:service. Listen 0.0.0.0:$PORT (default 8080). GET /hello?name=
import os
from flask import Flask, request

app = Flask(__name__)

@app.route("/hello")
def hello():
    name = request.args.get("name", "")  # wb:source id=src
    return f"<h1>{name}</h1>"  # wb:sink id=sink

@app.route("/health")
def wb_health():
    return "ok"


if __name__ == "__main__":
    app.run(host="0.0.0.0", port=int(os.environ.get("PORT", "8080")))
POS
	'safefile://app.py': <<<NEG
# HTTP service wb:service. Listen 0.0.0.0:$PORT (default 8080). GET /hello?name=
from html import escape
import os
from flask import Flask, request

app = Flask(__name__)

@app.route("/hello")
def hello():
    name = request.args.get("name", "")  # wb:source id=src
    return f"<h1>{escape(name)}</h1>"  # wb:sink id=sink

@app.route("/health")
def wb_health():
    return "ok"


if __name__ == "__main__":
    app.run(host="0.0.0.0", port=int(os.environ.get("PORT", "8080")))
NEG
)
